# format=FAST
# Fusion MS-WB670 at source 51, commanded by a B&G Zeus SRX at source 39.
#
# 126720 proprietary id 22 "Set Equalizer", previously undecoded. The payload
# is the same shape as the 130820 Tone status: zone, bass, mid, treble, each a
# signed byte. Every command carries the full triple rather than a delta.
#
# Operator actions, each echoed by the unit ~20 ms later:
#   bass 4 -> 8   (mid already at 3)
#   bass 8 -> 0
#   mid  3 -> 0
#
# The MS-WB670 exposes a single master tone control, so the zone byte was only
# ever observed as 0; the field is nevertheless present on the wire.
#
